-`uint32`, `uint16 s_major`, `uint16 s_minor`; S112 :124-137) and the v1/v2 packed tail at offset
-32 (`block_size_1:uint16`, `block_log:uint16`, `flags:uint8`, `no_uids:uint8`, `no_guids:uint8`,
-`mkfs_time:uint32`) in the carrier's own byte order.
